fields.value:
{{Disjointnotes
| name = Death Ward
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} The attack projectile does not continue bouncing when disjointed by the primary attack target.<br><br>{{Symbol|bonus agh}} When disjointed by a secondary target, the disjointing unit is not registered as hit, so the attack may immediately bounce on it again if within range.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Death Ward icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Summons a deadly ward to attack enemy heroes within its attack range. Lasts a maximum of 8 seconds. Death Ward has 50% bonus accuracy.
}}
* {{Symbol|Damage|Pure}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage}}
** The attack projectile directly utilizes and applies [[pure]] attack damage and has the following mechanic interactions:
*** Affected by both {{M|main attack damage}} and {{M|total attack damage}} manipulation sources when applicable.
*** Does not interact with {{M|armor}} sources.
*** The following {{M|incoming damage}} reduction sources do not interact with this player-based damage source, due to the damage being sourced to the Death Ward:
**** {{A|Lich|Frost Shield}}
**** {{A|Mars|Bulwark}} only redirects the primary projectile.
***** However, it cannot reduce the damage of either the primary projectile or {{ValueColor||the bouncing projectile|agh}}.
**** {{A|Ogre Magi|Fire Shield}}
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
** Bounced attacks are considered [[instant attack]]s with the following properties:
*** Deals a {{Code|0}}-attack damage instance, with a fixed {{#var:Death Ward value4}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Death Ward value4 tal}}|25tal}}) {{M|pure}} {{M|spell damage}} bonus added upon projectile impact.
*** The applied damage neither interacts with [[damage manipulation]] sources, nor applies most {{M|on-damage effects}}.
**** Hence the accuracy component only applies to the first attacked target.
**** Does not grant shared vision on instant attack-affected enemy units.
** Has the following auto-attack priorities:
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} Nearest Enemy Heroes {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} Nearest Enemy Units

